      "query_sha256": "f88d6c4971a938b395ec65fcac220bb52d6b3e20e1c8733575ab77a195624d74",
      "title": "A Bessel-zero obstruction to hyperbolic complete monotonicity of noncentral chi-square densities",
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.22066v1"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We simplify the proof of some widely used theoretical theorems, extending their applicability, while correcting some erroneous results. We also generalize key results and present new results that contribute to the development of the theory. Furthermore, we use the results obtained to investigate the monotonicity properties of some specific functions related to the Gamma function. Finally, we formulate an open problem related to the psi function.",
      "metadata_sha256": "3c498bf30927aa599b76670f1fa07a7e52a4096f2bb8cec88535c21f6a4d7da1",
      "provider": "arxiv",
      "provider_id": "2411.17670v3",
